### =====================================================================
### RPG Code Academy · ejemplos de todos los endpoints
### Abre este archivo con la extensión REST Client de VS Code y pulsa
### "Send Request" sobre cada bloque.
### =====================================================================

@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@supabase = https://TU-PROYECTO.supabase.co
@anonKey = TU_ANON_KEY

### 0 · Login contra Supabase Auth (esto lo hace el cliente, no el backend).
### Copia el access_token de la respuesta en la variable @token de abajo.
# @name login
POST {{supabase}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jugador@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "contrasena-de-prueba"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 1 · Salud (pública)
GET {{host}}/health

### 2 · Manifiesto de sprites (pública)
GET {{host}}/assets/manifest

### 3 · Mi perfil
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4 · Cambiar username y avatar
PATCH {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "frisk_dev",
  "avatar_key": "avatar_02"
}

### 5 · Crear personaje (una sola vez; desbloquea el primer nivel)
POST {{host}}/characters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Frisk",
  "class": "coder"
}

### 6 · Stats del personaje
GET {{host}}/characters/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7 · Mapa completo (una llamada pinta todo)
# @name map
GET {{host}}/map
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@levelId = {{map.response.body.data.worlds[0].chapters[0].levels[0].id}}

### 8 · Detalle del nivel
GET {{host}}/levels/{{levelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9 · Lección (la genera la IA la primera vez)
GET {{host}}/levels/{{levelId}}/lesson
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10 · Iniciar combate
# @name session
POST {{host}}/levels/{{levelId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@sessionId = {{session.response.body.data.session.id}}

### 11 · Estado de la partida (reanudar)
GET {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12 · Ejercicio actual (sin respuesta correcta)
GET {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13 · Pedir pista (escalonada, penaliza puntaje)
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/hint
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14 · Responder · opción múltiple
# client_attempt_id lo genera el cliente: hace la petición idempotente.
# @name answer
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_attempt_id": "8f1f2b0e-6d3a-4c2e-9a51-3f8a1d2b7c40",
  "answer": "b",
  "time_spent_ms": 4200
}

@attemptId = {{answer.response.body.data.attempt_id}}

### 15 · Responder · rellenar hueco
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_attempt_id": "1b2c3d4e-5f60-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
  "answer": "let"
}

### 16 · Responder · código (lo califica la IA contra la rúbrica)
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_attempt_id": "2c3d4e5f-6071-4b8c-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e",
  "answer": "function crearHeroe(nombre) {\n  return { nombre, hp: 100 };\n}",
  "time_spent_ms": 61000
}

### 17 · Reenviar la MISMA respuesta (idempotencia): no penaliza dos veces
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_attempt_id": "8f1f2b0e-6d3a-4c2e-9a51-3f8a1d2b7c40",
  "answer": "b"
}

### 18 · Explicación paso a paso del fallo
POST {{host}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/explain
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19 · Saltar ejercicio (consume una Ficha de Salto)
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/skip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20 · Abandonar la partida
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/abandon
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21 · Tienda
# @name items
GET {{host}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@itemId = {{items.response.body.data[0].id}}

### 22 · Comprar
POST {{host}}/shop/purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_id": "{{itemId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 23 · Inventario
# @name inventory
GET {{host}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@inventoryId = {{inventory.response.body.data[0].inventory_id}}

### 24 · Usar una poción dentro del combate
POST {{host}}/inventory/{{inventoryId}}/use
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{sessionId}}"
}

### 25 · Logros
GET {{host}}/achievements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26 · Racha
GET {{host}}/streak
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 27 · Reclamar recompensa diaria
POST {{host}}/streak/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28 · Leaderboard global histórico
GET {{host}}/leaderboard?scope=global&period=all&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 29 · Leaderboard de amigos, esta semana
GET {{host}}/leaderboard?scope=friends&period=week
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================================
### Admin (requiere profiles.is_admin = true)
### =====================================================================

### 30 · Regenerar contenido de un nivel
POST {{host}}/admin/levels/{{levelId}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 31 · Generar narrativa del nivel
POST {{host}}/admin/levels/{{levelId}}/narrative
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 32 · Crear mundo
POST {{host}}/admin/worlds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "cuevas-de-la-recursion",
  "name": "Cuevas de la Recursión",
  "narrative_theme": "Cuevas que se repiten dentro de sí mismas hasta el caso base.",
  "order_index": 2,
  "sprite_key": "world_caves",
  "color_palette": { "bg": "#0d0f1a", "accent": "#73eff7" }
}

### 33 · Crear capítulo
POST {{host}}/admin/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "world_id": "PEGA_UN_WORLD_ID",
  "slug": "caso-base",
  "name": "El Caso Base",
  "order_index": 1,
  "base_difficulty": 8
}

### 34 · Crear nivel
POST {{host}}/admin/levels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapter_id": "PEGA_UN_CHAPTER_ID",
  "slug": "factorial",
  "name": "Factorial",
  "order_index": 1,
  "type": "combat",
  "difficulty": 8,
  "concepts": ["recursion"],
  "xp_reward": 120,
  "coins_reward": 30,
  "exercise_count": 5,
  "enemy_name": "Eco Infinito",
  "enemy_sprite_key": "enemy_echo",
  "enemy_hp": 160,
  "enemy_damage": 28
}

### 35 · Gasto de IA de los últimos 30 días
GET {{host}}/admin/ai-costs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================================
### Errores que conviene probar
### =====================================================================

### Sin token → 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{host}}/me

### Nivel bloqueado → 403 LEVEL_LOCKED
POST {{host}}/levels/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Body inválido → 422 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{host}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "b"
}
